khamun","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox item\n| image    = File:Loreslave.jpg\n| type     = [[Tome]]\n| effects  = Research\n| users    = [[Blood Spiral]]\n| first    = \"[[The Unseen Guide]]\"\n| see also = [[Holotome]] <nowiki>|</nowiki> [[Cypherdex]] <nowiki>|</nowiki> [[Teknonomicon]]\n}}\nThe '''Loreslave''' is a [[Tome]] used by the [[Blood Spiral Brotherhood]]. This tome is blood red in color and has large, purple fangs which curl around the body. It is known that the Loreslave has the standard Tome abilities of providing information on [[Titans]] and locations.\n\n== Titan Profiles ==\n:''For a full listing of profiles, see [[Titan Profile database]].''\n---- \n* [[Anubian]] (\"[[The Unseen Guide]]\")\n* [[Hitokiri]] (\"[[Boys Will Be Seekers]]\")\n\n{{clear}}\n== Gallery ==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery captionalign=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\" position=\"center\">\nLoreslave.png\nLoreslave 2.png\nS1E20 Loreslave Anubian.png|Loreslave displaying [[Anubian]]\nS2E36 Loreslave.png\nS2E36 Loreslave Hitokiri.jpg|Loreslave displaying [[Hitokiri]]\nS2E47 Loreslave Necklace.png|Loreslave displaying the [[Necklace of Tutankhamun]]\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Tomes]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral]]\n[[Category:Need to rewrite]]","categories":["Blood Spiral","Need to rewrite","Tomes"],"links":[{"target_title":"Tome","label":"Tome","target_id":"huntik:page:3438","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Tome","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3438"},{"target_title":"Blood Spiral","label":"Blood Spiral","target_id":"huntik:page:3288","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Blood_Spiral","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3288"},{"target_title":"The Unseen Guide","label":"The Unseen Guide","target_id":"huntik:page:3229","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Unseen_Guide","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3229"},{"target_title":"Holotome","label":"Holotome","target_id":"huntik:page:2679","target_url":"https://huntik.